## What was delivered
9 files (2,222 lines) at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/ChargingOptimizerWidget.*` — a production SwiftUI parity of the web widget: compact / standard / **wide (24h rate timeline)** layouts, all six states (loading/empty/error/stale/offline/content), 3 metric tiles, schedule-match badge, recommendation tip cards. Bound through a P1/S8 state-holder seam (no view HTTP), P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, full i18n table, VoiceOver labels, registry `charging-optimizer` (2×2 / 1×2 / 4×40, clamp honored).

